Opera 1.0 runs on all your devices. Pair your phone with Sampler Hub on your computer to sync your chats and use its models and MCP servers. Opera is now on Windows, macOS and Linux too.

Put your phone on its charger for Standby, a clock where you just say "Maestro" and ask. Install the offline voice pack to give Maestro a natural voice.

You can also edit your messages and attach videos.
